      ],
      "text": "and the GDG panel has advised a relative ranking of preference among the three modified 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        299.5902404785156,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "regimens based on the review of multiple criteria.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.01862335205078,
        527.367919921875,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "(66) The evidence from the endTB trial (NCT02754765)   of all five regimens was assessed. The outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.947122573852539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4508056640625,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "of participants in five trial arms receiving modified 9-month regimens were compared with the trial’s",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.5010375976562,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "comparator arm, in which most participants received longer regimens. All five experimental regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986241340637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4332275390625,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "were of 9 months duration. Three of these regimens included bedaquiline (for the whole duration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.4353637695312,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "of the regimen), a quinolone (either moxifloxacin or levofloxacin), linezolid, pyrazinamide, and either",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.3892211914062,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "delamanid or clofazimine, or no fifth drug. The two remaining regimens were without bedaquiline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.3848876953125,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "but included delamanid, a quinolone (moxifloxacin or levofloxacin), clofazimine and pyrazinamide,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.584716796875,
        524.4051513671875,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.4 with or without linezolid as a fifth medicine (see  ). The assessment of three bedaquiline-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4056396484375,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "containing regimens showed higher levels of treatment success (89%, 88.7% and 85.2% vs 77%),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4266357421875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "slightly higher or lower failure or recurrence (3.4%, 6.1% and 1.6% vs 2.5%), lower levels of deaths",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.3990478515625,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "(1.7%, 0.9% and 2.5% vs 3.4%), lower levels of LTFU (5.9%, 4.3% and 10.7% vs 16.8%) and similar",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.4344482421875,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "levels of amplification of drug resistance (0.0%, 1.6% and 0.0% vs 0%) than the comparator. The two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.3526000976562,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "regimens without bedaquiline showed variable levels of treatment success (76.3% and 84.6% vs 77%),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980332374572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.3935546875,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "failure or recurrence (11% and 8.7% vs 2.5%), deaths (2.5% and 2.9% vs 3.4%) and LTFU (10.2% and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        450.49713134765625,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "3.8% vs 16.8%), and higher amplification of drug resistance (4.0% and 6.7% vs 0%).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4190063476562,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "Based on a review of these five assessments, it was considered that three bedaquiline-containing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.5047607421875,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "regimens (BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ) can be suggested for use in preference to currently",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.4014282226562,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "recommended longer (>18 months) regimens in patients with MDR/RR-TB and in whom resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.5904541015625,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "to FQ has been excluded. Additional assessment of multiple factors (including resource requirements,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9844388961792,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.4111328125,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "health equity, acceptability and access to delamanid) led to the conclusion that BLMZ is preferred",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.25634765625,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "over BLLfxCZ, and that BLLfxCZ is preferred over BDLLfxZ, because the net health effects appeared to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98138427734375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.4554443359375,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "be most favourable for BLMZ, followed by BLLfxCZ. The endTB trial enrolled patients with important",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.4539794921875,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "comorbidities and patients with extensive TB disease; therefore, in contrast to the recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        524.5116577148438,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "for the 9-month all-oral regimen, this recommendation can be extended to these groups of patients.",
